<!-- ─── §01 ─── -->
<section id="s-problem" data-code="problem">
<div class="section-no">01 — The Training Problem</div>
<h2>Wrapping a Frozen Giant</h2>
<p>
  Training an EAGLE-3 draft model requires the <em>target</em> model to run a full forward pass on every training sample — producing the hidden states the draft is trained to predict. In existing frameworks, both the frozen target and the trainable draft are wrapped inside a single FSDP/ZeRO module. This creates a fundamental mismatch: gradient-tracking infrastructure that the target will never use is applied uniformly to both models.
</p>
<p>
  The concrete consequence depends on which ZeRO stage you pick. ZeRO-2 replicates all target parameters on every device — fine for small targets, catastrophic for 235B. ZeRO-3 shards parameters but triggers a constant stream of all-gather operations during every target forward pass — fine for training, but inference engines like SGLang never need that synchronization pattern.
</p>

<!-- Architecture contrast SVG -->
<div class="vp">
  <div class="vp-head">
    <span class="vp-title">architecture-comparison.svg</span>
    <span class="vp-hint">Frozen target wrapped in gradient machinery vs. decoupled</span>
  </div>
  <div class="vp-body" style="padding:1.5rem">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 700 280" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto">
      <!-- ── LEFT: Naive ── -->
      <text x="155" y="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#f59e0b">NAIVE (single FSDP/ZeRO module)</text>
      <!-- Outer FSDP bubble -->
      <rect x="16" y="26" width="278" height="230" rx="12" fill="rgba(245,158,11,.06)" stroke="rgba(245,158,11,.5)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6,3"/>
      <text x="155" y="45" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="rgba(245,158,11,.7)">DeepSpeed / FSDP — ZeRO Stage 2 or 3</text>

      <!-- Target model box (frozen) -->
      <rect x="36" y="54" width="238" height="80" rx="8" fill="rgba(239,68,68,.1)" stroke="rgba(239,68,68,.5)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="155" y="82" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#ef4444">Frozen Target Model</text>
      <text x="155" y="97" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6b7280">e.g. Qwen3-235B-A22B</text>
      <text x="155" y="111" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="rgba(239,68,68,.8)">⚠ ZeRO2: fully replicated · ZeRO3: all-gather per step</text>
      <text x="155" y="126" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="rgba(239,68,68,.8)">⚠ HuggingFace inference (no FlashAttn-3, no CUDA Graph)</text>

      <!-- Draft model box -->
      <rect x="36" y="148" width="238" height="56" rx="8" fill="rgba(139,92,246,.1)" stroke="rgba(139,92,246,.5)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="155" y="173" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#8b5cf6">Draft Model (trainable)</text>
      <text x="155" y="189" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6b7280">~3–5% of target size · ZeRO Stage 2</text>

      <!-- Communication arrows -->
      <path d="M155 134 L155 148" stroke="rgba(245,158,11,.6)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-a)"/>
      <text x="200" y="143" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="rgba(245,158,11,.8)">hidden states</text>

      <!-- ── RIGHT: SpecForge ── -->
      <text x="519" y="18" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#10b981">SPECFORGE (target–draft decoupled)</text>

      <!-- SGLang box (target) -->
      <rect x="380" y="26" width="278" height="96" rx="8" fill="rgba(6,182,212,.08)" stroke="rgba(6,182,212,.5)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="519" y="50" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#06b6d4">SGLang Inference Engine</text>
      <text x="519" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6b7280">Frozen Target Model</text>
      <text x="519" y="81" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="rgba(6,182,212,.9)">✓ TP + Expert Parallelism + Pipeline Parallel</text>
      <text x="519" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="rgba(6,182,212,.9)">✓ FlashAttention-3 · FlashInfer · CUDA Graphs</text>
      <text x="519" y="111" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="rgba(6,182,212,.9)">✓ No gradient overhead · no ZeRO synchronization</text>

      <!-- FSDP box (draft only) -->
      <rect x="380" y="148" width="278" height="76" rx="8" fill="rgba(139,92,246,.1)" stroke="rgba(139,92,246,.5)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="519" y="173" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#8b5cf6">FSDP / ZeRO Stage 2</text>
      <text x="519" y="189" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6b7280">Draft Model only · lightweight optimizer sharding</text>
      <text x="519" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" fill="rgba(16,185,129,.9)">✓ No all-gather on frozen params · optimal for small draft</text>

      <!-- Arrow right -->
      <path d="M519 122 L519 148" stroke="rgba(6,182,212,.6)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-c)"/>
      <text x="560" y="138" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="rgba(6,182,212,.8)">hidden states</text>

      <!-- Divider -->
      <line x1="350" y1="10" x2="350" y2="270" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.08)" stroke-width="1"/>

      <!-- GPU row indicator -->
