    <p>Third, SpecBundle Training Recipe. SpecForge introduces a training data methodology: regenerating responses directly from the target model at a temperature of 0.8. This teaches the draft model to mimic the target's exact output distribution and vocabulary style rather than generic dataset responses, resulting in an additional 5.3% system throughput speedup.</p>
    <p>Together, these optimizations make draft model training up to 9.99 times faster on large models like Qwen3-235B, enabling rapid iteration of high-performance drafters.</p>
